	(text "STM32F411CEU6 capture engine. Clock, decoupling, reset, boot\nand the SWD debug header.\n\nCONSTRAINTS\n\n1. The pin map is fixed by harness_spec.md. Do not reassign pins\n   here. Firmware programs these exact pins, and the file and the\n   firmware are not allowed to drift apart.\n\n2. CNVR_A and CNVR_B sit on PB0 and PB1 so they take EXTI0 and\n   EXTI1, which have their own interrupt vectors. EXTI9_5 and\n   EXTI15_10 are shared vectors and would make the two streams of\n   14,286 edges per second wait behind each other. Because the EXTI\n   line number equals the pin number on any port, pin numbers 0 and\n   1 are now closed to every other edge input on this board.\n\n3. The phase bits use PA2 to PA7, contiguous inside GPIOA, so one\n   read of GPIOA->IDR latches both nodes at once. A code assembled\n   from two ports needs two reads, and a transition landing in the\n   gap between them produces exactly the invalid code that Gray\n   coding was adopted to make impossible.\n\n4. PB4 configured as I2C3_SDA releases NJTRST, so JTAG is gone once\n   the sensor bus is brought up. SWD on PA13 and PA14 is the only\n   debug path left. Do not remove the SWD header.\n\n5. One 100 nF per supply pin, placed at the pin it serves. A shared\n   capacitor means a longer current loop, which defeats the point.\n\n6. SWDIO pulls up, SWCLK pulls down, BOOT0 pulls down, all 10k.\n   These are pulls to a rail. They are not resistors in series with\n   the signal. In series they would still pass ERC and still break\n   the debug link.\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nSTM32F411CEU6 采集引擎。时钟、去耦、复位、启动和 SWD 调试接口。\n\n约束\n\n1. 引脚分配由 harness_spec.md 固定。不要在这里改引脚。固件烧的就是\n   这些引脚，该文件和固件不允许出现分歧。\n\n2. CNVR_A 和 CNVR_B 放在 PB0 和 PB1，因此占用 EXTI0 和 EXTI1，\n   这两条线有各自独立的中断向量。EXTI9_5 和 EXTI15_10 是共享向量，\n   会让两路每秒 14,286 个边沿的信号互相排队等待。由于 EXTI 线号等于\n   引脚号，与端口无关，引脚号 0 和 1 在本板上已经对其他所有边沿输入\n   关闭。\n\n3. 相位比特使用 PA2 到 PA7，在 GPIOA 内连续排列，因此读一次\n   GPIOA->IDR 就能同时锁存两个节点。用两个端口拼出来的编码需要读两\n   次，而恰好落在两次读之间的跳变会产生无效编码，这正是采用格雷码要\n   杜绝的情况。\n\n4. PB4 配置为 I2C3_SDA 会释放 NJTRST，所以传感器总线一初始化，\n   JTAG 就没了。PA13 和 PA14 上的 SWD 是唯一剩下的调试通道。\n   不要删掉 SWD 接口。\n\n5. 每个电源引脚配一颗 100 nF，就近放在它所服务的那个引脚旁边。多个\n   引脚共用一颗电容会拉长电流回路，等于白放。\n\n6. SWDIO 上拉，SWCLK 下拉，BOOT0 下拉，都是 10k。这些是接到电源轨\n   的上下拉，不是串在信号线上的电阻。串进去一样能通过 ERC，但调试链\n   路会坏掉。"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
